---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Medical Disclaimer">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 space-y-8 prose text-stone-800">
    <div class="space-y-2 border-b border-stone-200 pb-6">
      <span class="badge-reviewed">Clinical Scope Notice</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-[#1B4332]">Medical Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-stone-500">Last Reviewed: January 15, 2025</p>
    </div>

    <div class="disclaimer-box text-base font-medium leading-relaxed">
      <strong>IMPORTANT NOTICE:</strong> The materials, articles, conditions guides, calculators, and interactive tools available on doctorameena.com are provided strictly for general educational, informational, and reference purposes. Nothing on this website constitutes direct formal medical advice, diagnosis, treatment, or establishment of a doctor-patient relationship.
    </div>

    <h2>1. Educational Content Purpose</h2>
    <p>
      The endocrine condition summaries, diagnostic lab thresholds (e.g. TSH, A1C, Free T4 ranges), treatment overviews, and patient guides presented on this site are designed to empower patient education in collaboration with qualified healthcare professionals. They must never be used to self-diagnose or self-treat medical conditions.
    </p>

    <h2>2. No Doctor-Patient Relationship Established</h2>
    <p>
      Reading content, interacting with symptom checklists, or submitting an online appointment request through doctorameena.com does <strong>not</strong> establish a formal physician-patient relationship with Dr. Ameena, MD. A formal physician-patient relationship is established only after an in-person or formal telehealth consultation and completion of signed clinical consent documentation.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Emergency Medical Situations</h2>
    <p>
      If you are experiencing severe medical symptoms—such as severe chest pain, extreme dyspnea, confusion, symptoms of severe hypoglycemia, or acute thyroid storm—do <strong>not</strong> rely on website communications. Call 911 immediately or proceed to the nearest hospital emergency room.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Credential & Location Confirmation</h2>
    <p>
      Certain administrative items on this preview website—including exact state license numbers, hospital privilege lists, fee schedules, and specific insurance panel inclusions—are marked with <span class="bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 text-xs px-1 rounded font-bold">[NEEDS CONFIRMATION]</span> tags to maintain strict compliance with healthcare transparency guidelines pending administrative verification.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
